      "cooked": "<p>[size=100]Here’s a project we can all get behind: a Kickstarter for a new geek hangout, where they’ll be showing Battlestar Galactica on the bigscreen over the bar, instead of football! [sup]1[/sup]</p>\n<p>I think I’m going to back it. <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/951947596/the-8-bit-bar-st-louiss-geek-bar\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Go check out the 8-Bit Bar on Kickstarter.</a>[/size]</p>\n<p>[hr][/hr]<br>\n<font size=\"100\"><span class=\"bbcode-b\">1.</span> Well, all of us who are within a hundred miles of the Greater Than Games world headquarters in St. Louis, Missouri.</font> [sup]2[/sup]<br>\n<font size=\"80\"><br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">2.</span> And are over the age of 21, of course. </font>[sup]3[/sup]<br>\n<font size=\"60\"><br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">3.</span> Which is not to say that they won’t take your money if you’re younger than 21. Of course they can do <span class=\"bbcode-u\">that</span>. They just can’t let you sit at the bar. Yet. So, you know, check them out and throw them some bucks anyway. You’ll like it better in a few years anyway, when they’ve worked the bugs out.</font></p>",
